I won't let this love go!

54
00:02:00,330 --> 00:02:04,680
The final match between Nankatsu and Toho started with a bang!

55
00:02:00,350 --> 00:02:05,350
EPISODE 47: ONCE MORE AN INEVITABLE SHOWDOWN

56
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,680
The ball is being replaced now.

57
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:10,670
The power and speed to burst the ball...

58
00:02:10,670 --> 00:02:12,180
So this is the Tiger Shot.

59
00:02:10,670 --> 00:02:12,180
Tiger Shot

60
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:15,080
Who would have thought Hyuga possessed such a superb shot...

61
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,700
What are you talking about, everyone?

62
00:02:17,070 --> 00:02:18,760
We have Tsubasa—

63
00:02:21,250 --> 00:02:24,040
No... In this final match, we...

64
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:26,540
We have to do our best!

65
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:29,290
If our spirits waver, we can't beat Toho!

66
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:32,360
Yeah, Ishizaki is right!

67
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:35,170
You're right. We must give it our all!

68
00:02:35,170 --> 00:02:35,880
Let's go!

69
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:39,810
We have to score the first goal and take some of the load off Tsubasa's shoulders!

70
00:02:39,810 --> 00:02:40,680
Yes!

71
00:02:41,230 --> 00:02:42,510
Everyone...

72
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:44,770
Bring it on, Nankatsu.

73
00:02:44,770 --> 00:02:47,260
No matter how closely you mark Hyuga-san,

74
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:50,230
I'll slip through and make sure my passes reach him!

75
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,940
Here we come, Tsubasa!

76
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:59,280
The Tiger Shot has ignited Tsubasa-kun's fighting spirit!

77
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:59,280
Tiger Shot

78
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:03,030
Tsubasa-kun approached Toho's half with vigor!

79
00:03:03,950 --> 00:03:05,540
Tsubasa!

80
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:12,410
Here's an attack from Nankatsu's former Shutetsu Trio,

81
00:03:12,410 --> 00:03:17,670
Izawa-kun, Taki-kun, and Kisugi-kun, who have grown even stronger during this tournament.

82
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,860
In this last match...

83
00:03:19,860 --> 00:03:21,930
We can't put all the work on Tsubasa.

84
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:23,810
We have to do this!

85
00:03:23,810 --> 00:03:25,140
Let's go, Toho!

86
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:30,390
Damn it! As expected, Tsubasa's attacks are so fluid!

87
00:03:30,390 --> 00:03:32,390
Captain! Please don't come here!

88
00:03:32,390 --> 00:03:35,150
We'll stop this attack ourselves!

89
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:35,770
Everyone!

90
00:03:35,770 --> 00:03:37,430
Nankatsu is attacking!

91
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:40,400
However, Toho's defense in front of the goal is invincible!

92
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,910
As if I'll let you shoot!

93
00:03:42,490 --> 00:03:43,490
Izawa!

94
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:45,990
The ball is back to Izawa-kun!

95
00:03:46,950 --> 00:03:47,970
He's going to shoot!

96
00:03:47,970 --> 00:03:49,060
We'll stop it!

97
00:03:49,060 --> 00:03:50,500
Let him shoot!

98
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:53,500
If it's from that distance, it doesn't matter!

99
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:54,250
What—

100
00:03:54,250 --> 00:03:55,250
Wakashimazu!

101
00:03:55,250 --> 00:03:57,590
Damn it! Are you making a fool of me?

102
00:03:57,590 --> 00:03:58,170
Go!

103
00:03:58,170 --> 00:03:59,170
Izawa!

104
00:03:59,170 --> 00:04:01,090
Let me shoot!

105
00:04:01,090 --> 00:04:01,970
Ishizaki!

106
00:04:01,970 --> 00:04:04,260
Wakashimazu!

107
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:07,540
Izawa-kun looked like he would shoot, but here's a shot from Ishizaki-kun!

108
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:10,020
Don't dare underestimate Nankatsu!

109
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,770
Wakashimazu-kun was distracted for a moment!

110
00:04:13,810 --> 00:04:17,670
Still, Wakashimazu-kun manages to perfectly catch Ishizaki-kun's shot

111
00:04:17,670 --> 00:04:21,530
aimed at the corner of the goal!

112
00:04:21,530 --> 00:04:23,030
Good job, Wakashimazu!

113
00:04:23,030 --> 00:04:23,780
Damn it!

114
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:25,370
That was close, Ishizaki!

115
00:04:27,260 --> 00:04:31,350
Not just Tsubasa, I can't lower my guard against the rest of Nankatsu either...

116
00:04:31,350 --> 00:04:34,710
Wakashimazu, as long as we have you, I'm not worried.

117
00:04:34,710 --> 00:04:36,530
Now it's my turn.

118
00:04:36,530 --> 00:04:39,750
I'll score my goal with the Tiger Shot!

119
00:04:36,530 --> 00:04:39,750
Tiger Shot

120
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:43,620
Against anyone else, that shot would have been a goal.

121
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:46,640
It's true that Wakashimazu-kun is no ordinary goalkeeper.

122
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:51,350
While my leg is still good, I should put us ahead with a Drive Shot...

123
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:51,350
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

124
00:04:51,350 --> 00:04:57,220
Hyuga-kun might truly be an eternal rival for Tsubasa-kun.

125
00:04:57,220 --> 00:05:00,460
Because, as I see it, every time he plays against him,

126
00:05:00,460 --> 00:05:02,860
Tsubasa-kun shines.

127
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:03,950
Here!

128
00:05:03,950 --> 00:05:06,520
Toho passes the ball around the midfield area.

129
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,450
Of course, they're trying to get it to Hyuga,

130
00:05:08,450 --> 00:05:12,620
who has returned to play in the tournament armed with the Tiger Shot.

131
00:05:12,620 --> 00:05:14,620
Mark Hyuga tightly!

132
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:15,500
Okay!

133
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:19,250
The ball was sent to first-year playmaker Sawada-kun!

134
00:05:19,250 --> 00:05:21,670
No matter what, I have to pass to Hyuga-san!

135
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:25,590
Coming to mark Sawada-kun is none other than Tsubasa-kun!

136
00:05:25,590 --> 00:05:26,800
Tsubasa-san!

137
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:29,560
To prevent Hyuga-kun from using his Tiger Shot,

138
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:29,560
Tiger Shot

139
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,400
I'll stop Takeshi first.

140
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:34,730
A showdown between two control towers in midfield!

141
00:05:34,730 --> 00:05:36,310
Just like in my match!

142
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:40,900
In football, whoever controls the midfield can turn the match to their advantage.

143
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:44,190
Tsubasa-san has come this far following that principle.

144
00:05:44,190 --> 00:05:45,450
I'm coming, Takeshi!

145
00:05:46,070 --> 00:05:48,450
Send the ball to me, Takeshi!

146
00:05:48,450 --> 00:05:50,090
Koike senpai!

147
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:54,790
As a playmaker, Tsubasa-san is my idol!

148
00:05:54,790 --> 00:05:55,830
Takeshi!

149
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:57,540
Please,

150
00:05:57,540 --> 00:05:59,500
let me confront him now!

151
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:02,250
Sawada-kun faces off against Tsubasa-kun!

152
00:06:02,250 --> 00:06:02,920
Takeshi!

153
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:07,010
Izawa-kun slides in and cuts the duel short!

154
00:06:07,010 --> 00:06:07,840
What?!

155
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,340
Nice, Izawa!

156
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:11,890
Nankatsu's Shutetsu Trio attack!

157
00:06:11,890 --> 00:06:13,260
As Izawa-kun advances,

158
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:14,390
Taki-kun on his right

159
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:16,180
and Kisugi-kun on his left.

160
00:06:16,180 --> 00:06:17,940
Who will he pass to?

161
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:18,720
We won't allow it!

162
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,190
Yes!

163
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:22,320
Izawa, over here!

164
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:23,570
Tsubasa!

165
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:24,640
Okay!

166
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,070
Izawa-kun sent the ball back!

167
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:26,990
And...

168
00:06:26,990 --> 00:06:29,570
The ball reaches Tsubasa-kun!

169
00:06:29,570 --> 00:06:31,820
I'll do this for everyone!

170
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:33,120
Tsubasa senpai!

171
00:06:34,220 --> 00:06:34,990
Tsubasa-kun!

172
00:06:35,410 --> 00:06:36,450
Go!

173
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,710
Drive Shot!

174
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,710
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

175
00:06:38,710 --> 00:06:39,810
There it is!

176
00:06:39,810 --> 00:06:43,170
This time it's Tsubasa-kun's super shot, the Drive Shot!

177
00:06:39,810 --> 00:06:43,170
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

178
00:06:43,170 --> 00:06:44,090
Here it comes!

179
00:06:44,090 --> 00:06:45,300
Wakashimazu!

180
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:52,260
So this is Tsubasa's Drive Shot!

181
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:52,260
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

182
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:54,510
This will be the first time I see it directly.

183
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:59,270
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun moved against the Drive Shot.

184
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:59,270
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

185
00:07:02,030 --> 00:07:03,900
But he can't reach it!

186
00:07:05,870 --> 00:07:08,320
The ball bursts as it hits the goalpost!

187
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:11,070
That's what we witnessed with the Tiger Shot!

188
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:11,070
Tiger Shot

189
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:14,240
The power behind the Drive Shot is insane!

190
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:17,000
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

191
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:17,000
I can't use my Drive Shot as much as I'd like. However...

192
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,770
U-Unbelievable...

193
00:07:18,770 --> 00:07:22,330
Tsubasa's Drive Shot is also something to watch out for.

194
00:07:18,770 --> 00:07:22,330
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

195
00:07:22,330 --> 00:07:25,670
Its speed was on par with our captain's Tiger Shot...

196
00:07:22,330 --> 00:07:25,670
Tiger Shot

197
00:07:25,670 --> 00:07:27,510
It flies to the target, then drops.

198
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:30,430
No... It doesn't just drop.

199
00:07:30,430 --> 00:07:31,680
It dives.

200
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,680
It's as if the ball aims to dive down.

201
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:39,680
Both teams have relentlessly attacked and defended from start to finish!

202
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:43,700
And in this battle, the showdown between Hyuga-kun's Tiger Shot,

203
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:43,700
Tiger Shot

204
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:47,150
surpassing middle school level, and Tsubasa-kun's Drive Shot

205
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:47,150
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

206
00:07:47,150 --> 00:07:49,530
is quite breathtaking!

207
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:52,030
Well played, Toho.

208
00:07:52,030 --> 00:07:54,520
Nankatsu is truly a force to be reckoned with...

209
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:57,540
Only 5 minutes have passed in the first half.

210
00:07:57,540 --> 00:08:00,010
Both teams seem evenly matched so far.

211
00:08:00,010 --> 00:08:00,540
Yeah.

212
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:02,920
Are you okay, Wakashimazu?

213
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,880
Everyone...

214
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:07,230
I might have found a clue to stopping the Drive Shot.

215
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:07,230
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

216
00:08:07,690 --> 00:08:09,170
Wakashimazu-san?!

217
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,090
Wakashimazu...

218
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:13,720
Captain!

219
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:16,720
Please take another Tiger Shot for me!

220
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:16,720
Tiger Shot

221
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:20,120
It will work as a countermeasure against Tsubasa's Drive Shot in the final.

222
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:20,120
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

223
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,000
Please!

224
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,380
My shot has no spin, you know.

225
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:28,900
But I think the speed and power are similar.

226
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,900
Please!

227
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,780
Alright, I got it!

228
00:08:41,410 --> 00:08:42,930
Damn it...

229
00:08:42,930 --> 00:08:44,330
So I can't do it after all...

230
00:08:44,330 --> 00:08:46,130
Okay! Once more!

231
00:08:46,130 --> 00:08:47,880
I'm coming!

232
00:08:53,050 --> 00:08:56,260
All thanks to my special training with the captain...

233
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:57,720
I'll stop it!

234
00:08:57,720 --> 00:09:02,140
I, Ken Wakashimazu, will stop Tsubasa Ozora's Drive Shot!

235
00:08:57,720 --> 00:09:02,140
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

236
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:05,340
So, guys, as always,

237
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:06,480
put your whole soul into the game!

238
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,690
Yes!

239
00:09:08,450 --> 00:09:11,190
Wakashimazu was always so calm.

240
00:09:11,190 --> 00:09:16,490
While I wasn't playing, you held Toho together.

241
00:09:16,490 --> 00:09:19,620
No, it wasn't just Wakashimazu.

242
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:21,120
Captain! Please don't come here!

243
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:23,870
We'll stop this attack ourselves!

244
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:25,920
Let me confront him now!

245
00:09:26,540 --> 00:09:29,860
You've all grown so much...!

246
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:33,920
The game continues with a new ball.

247
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:38,590
Hyuga-kun has left Nankatsu's goal and returned to the midfield.

248
00:09:38,590 --> 00:09:39,390
Hyuga!

249
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,600
Just as the coach said.

250
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:45,180
I bear a great responsibility for selfishly leaving my team.

251
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:47,790
For everyone here fighting to win their own way,

252
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:51,610
I, Kojiro Hyuga, will score the first goal!

253
00:09:51,610 --> 00:09:53,520
Send it to me, Wakashimazu!

254
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,490
Captain!

255
00:09:54,490 --> 00:09:55,990
Alright!

256
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,910
The ball goes to Hyuga-kun!

257
00:09:58,910 --> 00:10:01,830
Does he intend to take on the playmaker role in midfield?

258
00:10:01,830 --> 00:10:02,950
Hyuga-san...?

259
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,260
Mark him!

260
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:09,960
Even from that far away, he could unleash a Tiger Shot!

261
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:09,960
Tiger Shot

262
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:13,010
If you mark me here, the front of your goal

263
00:10:13,010 --> 00:10:14,800
will be left unprotected.

264
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:17,950
Pull back, Ishizaki, Nakazato!

265
00:10:17,950 --> 00:10:20,220
We'll mark Hyuga in midfield!

266
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:21,600
O-Okay!

267
00:10:22,470 --> 00:10:23,400
Now!

268
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,980
Before being marked, Hyuga-kun sends a pass!

269
00:10:25,980 --> 00:10:28,030
But there's no one up front...?

270
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:30,300
Ah! Sawada-kun is there!

271
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:33,900
Midfielder Sawada-kun is running into the forward position!

272
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:34,940
Hyuga...

273
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:37,780
Hyuga-kun and Sawada-kun have switched places.

274
00:10:37,780 --> 00:10:38,680
This looks bad!

275
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:39,570
Fall back!

276
00:10:39,570 --> 00:10:43,280
Midfielder Kojiro Hyuga, huh...

277
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:47,710
Thanks to mastering this long-range Tiger Shot,

278
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:47,710
Tiger Shot

279
00:10:47,710 --> 00:10:50,610
even while being marked in midfield, he allows

280
00:10:50,610 --> 00:10:53,540
other players to get free.

281
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,670
Alright! I'm coming!

282
00:10:56,420 --> 00:11:00,100
Tsubasa-kun goes to mark Sawada-kun!

283
00:11:01,140 --> 00:11:04,640
Did he see through Toho's plan of switching positions?

284
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:06,590
You're amazing, Tsubasa!

285
00:11:06,590 --> 00:11:08,140
Well done, Football Kid!

286
00:11:08,620 --> 00:11:09,690
Tsubasa-san...

287
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:12,060
Now!

288
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:15,210
A perfectly coordinated play between Sawada-kun and Toho's second forward,

289
00:11:15,210 --> 00:11:17,900
Sorimachi-kun!

290
00:11:17,900 --> 00:11:19,650
Alright! Go on, Sorimachi!

291
00:11:19,650 --> 00:11:21,450
Sorimachi-kun shoots!

292
00:11:23,570 --> 00:11:26,830
But Morisaki-kun jumps sideways and clears it!

293
00:11:26,830 --> 00:11:28,200
Nice, Morisaki!

294
00:11:28,810 --> 00:11:31,370
Toho narrowly missed a chance to score!

295
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:35,510
Izawa-kun and Hyuga-kun chase after the ball.

296
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:36,090
What?!

297
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:38,010
Captain!

298
00:11:38,010 --> 00:11:39,380
No way!

299
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:40,410
Alright!

300
00:11:40,410 --> 00:11:42,180
The ball is Hyuga's!

301
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:44,050
He's advancing down the sideline.

302
00:11:44,050 --> 00:11:44,800
Hyuga-san!

303
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:45,720
Captain!

304
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:48,280
Sawada and Sorimachi are in front of the goal!

305
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:50,520
Who will he send the ball to?

306
00:11:54,020 --> 00:11:55,060
I can see it!

307
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:56,260
Eat this!

308
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:59,570
Tiger Shot!

309
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:59,570
Tiger Shot

310
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,060
It's in!

311
00:12:06,060 --> 00:12:08,750
Nankatsu couldn't even move a muscle!

312
00:12:08,750 --> 00:12:09,500
That's it!

313
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:12,830
Hyuga-kun scored directly with an angled shot!

314
00:12:12,830 --> 00:12:18,730
With the second Tiger Shot today, Toho Academy opened the scoring!

315
00:12:12,830 --> 00:12:18,730
Tiger Shot

316
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:27,760
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

317
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:32,270
In the grand final of the National Middle School Football Tournament,

318
00:12:32,270 --> 00:12:34,240
Toho Academy opened the scoring!

319
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:37,190
It's also Hyuga-kun's first goal of the tournament!

320
00:12:37,190 --> 00:12:39,320
We did it! The first goal is ours!

321
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,860
He did it! He did it!

322
00:12:40,860 --> 00:12:43,070
My big brother did it!

323
00:12:44,230 --> 00:12:45,700
Kojiro...

324
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:47,250
We did it!

325
00:12:47,250 --> 00:12:49,160
You did it, Hyuga-san!

326
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:51,330
As expected of our captain.

327
00:12:51,330 --> 00:12:55,080
Even if there's any opening, he can score.

328
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:59,340
A powerful straight shot, that is the essence of Kojiro Hyuga's Tiger Shot.

329
00:12:55,080 --> 00:13:04,800
Tiger Shot

330
00:12:59,970 --> 00:13:04,800
The fang of a tiger sinking in as fast as light. Tiger Shot...

331
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:09,510
Truly, this is a fitting move for Kojiro.

332
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:12,270
Even though he hasn't played with the team for a while,

333
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:15,390
he was able to blend into the teamwork easily.

334
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:18,270
Everyone, don't let your guard down just because we scored once.

335
00:13:18,270 --> 00:13:20,050
The real match starts now.

336
00:13:20,050 --> 00:13:20,900
Okay!

337
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:23,090
Perhaps, despite my reasons,

338
00:13:23,090 --> 00:13:27,280
the team truly needed Kojiro Hyuga.

339
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:30,490
I couldn't move a single step.

340
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:33,750
Sorry, it was just because I let him get open.

341
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:37,460
The Tiger Shot is truly an incredible shot.

342
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:37,460
Tiger Shot

343
00:13:37,460 --> 00:13:38,380
Tsubasa...!

344
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:41,380
We have to do everything to prevent him from using it again.

345
00:13:41,950 --> 00:13:44,040
We won't let Hyuga-kun get free.

346
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:47,460
Also, as appropriate, the midfielder should mark him when in midfield,

347
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:49,360
and the defenders should mark him when he's up front.

348
00:13:50,390 --> 00:13:53,020
Okay, let's pull ourselves together and retaliate!

349
00:13:53,020 --> 00:13:53,890
OKAY!

350
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:01,650
I'm coming, Hyuga-kun.

351
00:14:01,650 --> 00:14:03,800
Using my own Drive Shot, I'll return the favor

352
00:14:01,650 --> 00:14:05,950
Tiger Shot
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

353
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,950
for the goal you scored with the Tiger Shot.

354
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:09,120
The match continues!

355
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,590
Everyone, cheering is most important when we're behind!

356
00:14:11,590 --> 00:14:13,210
Let's do it loudly!

357
00:14:13,210 --> 00:14:15,680
Okay! Do your best, Nankatsu!

358
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:19,000
The match is on now! We trust you, boys!

359
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:21,690
The kids from Otomo, even though they're from a different school,

360
00:14:21,690 --> 00:14:24,130
have been cheering us on from the start...

361
00:14:24,420 --> 00:14:27,780
Thank you for everything you've done so far.

362
00:14:27,970 --> 00:14:30,470
We have to show them a bit, don't you think...?

363
00:14:30,470 --> 00:14:31,220
Tsubasa!

364
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:32,100
Take this!

365
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:35,270
Alright, go Ishizaki!

366
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:37,770
Ishizaki-kun is dribbling!

367
00:14:37,770 --> 00:14:39,150
Come on, now!

368
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:39,770
Stop him!

369
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:40,770
Hehe!

370
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:41,960
Take this!

371
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:43,050
A perfect move!

372
00:14:43,050 --> 00:14:45,280
Ishizaki-kun passes before getting past the defenders!

373
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:49,570
But Hyuga-kun in midfield blocks it!

374
00:14:49,570 --> 00:14:50,320
Damn it!

375
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,820
I'm coming, Hyuga-kun!

376
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:54,190
Alright! Come on, Tsubasa!

377
00:14:54,190 --> 00:14:55,080
Bring it!

378
00:14:55,080 --> 00:15:00,040
Now both captains will clash for the ball.

379
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:01,140
Tsubasa!

380
00:15:01,140 --> 00:15:02,040
Hyuga-san!

381
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:04,090
Don't, Tsubasa-kun! Your leg...

382
00:15:05,090 --> 00:15:09,090
However, Tsubasa-kun avoids the duel!

383
00:15:09,090 --> 00:15:09,590
What?!

384
00:15:10,020 --> 00:15:13,600
Good. If you care about your leg, that's the right decision.

385
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:17,630
You coward! You avoided the duel with our captain.

386
00:15:17,630 --> 00:15:18,720
How gutless!

387
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,690
You call yourself Nankatsu's captain?!

388
00:15:20,690 --> 00:15:21,770
What did you say?!

389
00:15:21,770 --> 00:15:24,900
Tsubasa! Come on, let's attack!

390
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:26,650
Alright, got it.

391
00:15:26,650 --> 00:15:28,030
Tsubasa!

392
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:30,150
Call me a coward if you want.

393
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:34,830
I can't afford to obsess over the battle in front of me and worsen my injury.

394
00:15:35,830 --> 00:15:39,080
I'm only thinking about winning this match.

395
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:41,080
Tsubasa-kun's magnificent dribbling

396
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,250
makes you wonder if he's really injured!

397
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:47,000
Tsubasa has always had a strong spirit of challenge.

398
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:51,000
This man's true power only emerges when he falls behind

399
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:54,010
and is pushed into a corner.

400
00:15:54,050 --> 00:15:57,260
The real reason he avoided our duel

401
00:15:57,260 --> 00:15:59,390
is that he's solely focused on winning this match.

402
00:16:00,390 --> 00:16:02,900
Tsubasa-kun is already in position to shoot!

403
00:16:02,900 --> 00:16:04,770
Everyone, stop Tsubasa!

404
00:16:04,770 --> 00:16:06,650
I won't let you shoot!

405
00:16:06,650 --> 00:16:07,860
Tsubasa, behind you!

406
00:16:10,020 --> 00:16:13,590
Tsubasa-kun managed to evade Sawada-kun's challenge!

407
00:16:13,590 --> 00:16:15,370
He's ready to shoot again!

408
00:16:15,370 --> 00:16:17,330
Stop him! Put a wall in front of him!

409
00:16:17,330 --> 00:16:19,910
Don't let him shoot!

410
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:22,790
Go, Drive Shot!

411
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:22,790
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

412
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:25,340
Smash through the wall!

413
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:31,720
Can he really aim for a goal when he hits it that high?!

414
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:35,230
Of course; the Tiger Shot can pierce the target at a glance,

415
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:35,230
Tiger Shot

416
00:16:35,230 --> 00:16:39,640
But the Drive Shot doesn't even need that to be successful!

417
00:16:35,230 --> 00:16:41,390
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

418
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:41,390
Come on, Drive Shot!

419
00:16:41,390 --> 00:16:45,470
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun chose to stay in front of the goal

420
00:16:45,470 --> 00:16:48,020
and quickly reacts to the Drive Shot!

421
00:16:45,470 --> 00:16:48,020
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

422
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:48,820
What?!

423
00:16:48,820 --> 00:16:51,540
Usually when a goalkeeper tries to stop a shot,

424
00:16:51,540 --> 00:16:54,770
he moves forward to limit the shot's success angle.

425
00:16:54,770 --> 00:16:56,740
However, if you move forward against the Drive Shot,

426
00:16:54,770 --> 00:16:56,740
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

427
00:16:56,740 --> 00:16:59,620
it will easily fly over your head and drop down.

428
00:17:00,370 --> 00:17:03,660
To stop the Drive Shot, stay as close to the goal as possible

429
00:17:00,370 --> 00:17:03,660
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

430
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:06,960
and react quickly to the path the ball is coming from,

431
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:11,460
then time your jump according to its acceleration!

432
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:16,520
He stopped it!

433
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:20,340
Wakashimazu-kun catches the ball with one hand before the goal line!

434
00:17:20,340 --> 00:17:23,230
The Drive Shot has been defeated!

435
00:17:20,340 --> 00:17:23,230
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

436
00:17:23,230 --> 00:17:24,300
Wakashimazu!

437
00:17:24,300 --> 00:17:25,480
You did it!

438
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:30,820
Ohhh!

439
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:32,570
But this—

440
00:17:34,320 --> 00:17:35,780
What?!

441
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:39,720
It seemed defeated, but the spin on Tsubasa-kun's

442
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:43,660
Drive Shot hasn't died yet!

443
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:43,660
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

444
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:45,100
The game is tied!

445
00:17:45,100 --> 00:17:50,170
Nankatsu equalized in the 10th minute of the first half!

446
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:52,920
You did it, Tsubasa! It's tied!

447
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,380
Tsubasa!

448
00:17:54,380 --> 00:17:57,430
Your Drive Shot is truly invincible!

449
00:17:54,380 --> 00:18:02,430
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

450
00:17:57,430 --> 00:18:02,430
The Drive Shot, which lets you shoot regardless of whether they try to block it...

451
00:18:02,430 --> 00:18:04,950
Powerful enough to send the goalkeeper flying.

452
00:18:04,950 --> 00:18:06,440
Truly amazing.

453
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:09,300
Even if they fall a goal behind, they quickly catch up.

454
00:18:09,300 --> 00:18:10,690
As expected of you, Tsubasa, you know!

455
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:15,040
The game is just tied, that's all. Now let's turn things around!

456
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:15,820
OKAY!

457
00:18:18,490 --> 00:18:20,720
Just as expected of you, Wakashimazu-kun.

458
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:23,750
Damn it, I thought I could stop it that way.

459
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:25,660
That was really close, Wakashimazu.

460
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:27,290
Captain!

461
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:29,410
But your hypothesis was correct.

462
00:18:29,410 --> 00:18:34,300
You are the first and only one to react to and touch the Drive Shot.

463
00:18:29,410 --> 00:18:34,300
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

464
00:18:34,300 --> 00:18:36,340
Have confidence and keep it up!

465
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:37,510
Of course!

466
00:18:38,430 --> 00:18:40,340
Drive Shot...

467
00:18:38,430 --> 00:18:40,340
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

468
00:18:40,340 --> 00:18:43,100
I'll somehow stop i—

469
00:18:47,780 --> 00:18:49,080
Or else...

470
00:18:50,650 --> 00:18:54,940
Wakashimazu can react to Tsubasa's Drive Shot.

471
00:18:50,650 --> 00:18:54,940
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

472
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:59,050
But so far, no one has been able to react to my Tiger Shot.

473
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:59,050
Tiger Shot

474
00:18:59,050 --> 00:19:02,950
If I can get the ball, anytime, I'll score a goal.

475
00:19:02,950 --> 00:19:06,200
The match has returned to where it started.

476
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:09,330
Go mark Hyuga!

477
00:19:11,250 --> 00:19:12,170
Got it!

478
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:15,320
After tying the score, Nankatsu steals the ball

479
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:17,800
and uses this momentum to attack!

480
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:18,760
Tsubasa!

481
00:19:20,450 --> 00:19:21,010
Alright!

482
00:19:21,890 --> 00:19:24,980
Tsubasa-kun has taken two Drive Shots so far,

483
00:19:21,890 --> 00:19:24,980
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

484
00:19:24,980 --> 00:19:26,310
and he's preparing for a third!

485
00:19:26,310 --> 00:19:28,310
As if we'll let you take another one!

486
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:31,900
Tsubasa-kun can't shoot as Toho's defenders close in!

487
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:33,400
He sends a last-second pass!

488
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,900
Taki!

489
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:36,110
Tsubasa!

490
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:38,110
The ball rises in front of the goal!

491
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:38,860
Alright!

492
00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:49,370
Tsubasa-kun and Wakashimazu-kun clash in the air.

493
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:53,080
Tsubasa!

494
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:54,590
Wakashimazu!

495
00:19:54,590 --> 00:19:56,630
Tsubasa senpai!

496
00:19:57,630 --> 00:20:00,470
For Wakashimazu's sake, I have to clear the ball!

497
00:20:00,470 --> 00:20:03,970
I will definitely use the chance Tsubasa gave!

498
00:20:03,970 --> 00:20:05,850
Kisugi-kun times his shot perfectly!

499
00:20:08,390 --> 00:20:11,140
But here's Sawada-kun, guarding the goal with a header!

500
00:20:11,140 --> 00:20:12,850
Toho averted the crisis!

501
00:20:12,850 --> 00:20:13,850
Tsubasa!

502
00:20:13,850 --> 00:20:15,110
Wakashimazu!

503
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:18,530
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

504
00:20:18,530 --> 00:20:20,780
Tsubasa, that was reckless!

505
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:22,900
Because you passed the ball.

506
00:20:22,900 --> 00:20:23,910
What—

507
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:26,060
Because you sent the ball...

508
00:20:26,060 --> 00:20:30,160
It was a pass from a friend, so he desperately tried to score.

509
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:33,580
I'm fine.

510
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:35,790
The match just started.

511
00:20:35,790 --> 00:20:37,690
Tsubasa...

512
00:20:37,690 --> 00:20:42,300
He's playing with injuries in both his left shoulder and leg.

513
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:45,300
We hope his performance won't be affected by this collision.

514
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:47,300
Are you okay, Wakashimazu?

515
00:20:47,300 --> 00:20:48,940
I just bumped a bit hard.

516
00:20:48,940 --> 00:20:50,350
It's nothing major.

517
00:20:53,190 --> 00:20:55,100
Wakashimazu...

518
00:20:55,500 --> 00:21:01,150
In elementary school, he broke his shoulder and leg in a traffic accident.

519
00:21:01,530 --> 00:21:05,530
Because of that, he couldn't join the team

520
00:21:05,530 --> 00:21:08,660
until the semi-finals of the National Youth Football Tournament.

521
00:21:08,660 --> 00:21:12,660
I hope the injury doesn't show itself now...

522
00:21:12,660 --> 00:21:16,500
A corner kick chance for Nankatsu!

523
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:18,250
I'm counting on you, Taki!

524
00:21:18,250 --> 00:21:19,000
Here we go!

525
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:21,260
Time to turn around!

526
00:21:21,260 --> 00:21:22,260
Leave it to me!

527
00:21:24,550 --> 00:21:26,800
Wakashimazu-kun clears the ball and relieves his team!

528
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:30,510
Wakashimazu normally could have caught this ball with both hands!

529
00:21:30,510 --> 00:21:32,140
Wakashimazu isn't his usual self!

530
00:21:32,140 --> 00:21:35,390
The cleared ball falls in front of Tsubasa-kun.

531
00:21:36,190 --> 00:21:39,390
This will be Tsubasa-kun's third Drive Shot today!

